OL,3,CBook of condolence opens for rugby
OL,4,Cleague legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,6,FWigan Warriors supporters are being
OL,7,Finvited to pay their respects to rugby
OL,8,Fleague legend Sir Billy Boston,
OL,9,Ffollowing his death at the age of 92.
OL,11,FA book of condolence has opened on
OL,12,FWednesday, 26 August, at Robin Park
OL,13,FArena to allow fans, local residents,
OL,14,Fand the wider rugby league community
OL,15,Fto leave their personal messages and
OL,16,Ftributes.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
