OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1787789950
OL,3,CBook of condolence opens for rugby
OL,4,Cleague legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,6,FOver a remarkable 15-year period, he
OL,7,Fscored 478 tries in 488 appearances,
OL,8,Fcementing his status as a permanent
OL,9,Ffixture of British sporting history
OL,10,Fand a legend of the town.
OL,12,FHis death on Monday, 24 August, was
OL,13,Fformally announced by his club.
OL,15,FIn a statement, Wigan Warriors said:
OL,16,F"Today we mourn the loss of a true
OL,17,Fsporting icon, Sir Billy Boston, who
OL,18,Fhas passed away surrounded by his
OL,19,Ffamily.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
