PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1787789950
OL,3,CBook of condolence opens for rugby
OL,4,Cleague legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,6,F"Rugby League's first knight, a Wigan
OL,7,Flegend, and "Everybody's Hero," his
OL,8,Flegacy on and off the field will
OL,9,Fendure for eternity. Rest in peace,
OL,10,FSir Billy."
OL,12,FTributes have continued to pour in
OL,13,Ffrom across the world since the
OL,14,Fannouncement, with figures from across
OL,15,Frugby league celebrating the life of
OL,16,Fthe sporting "giant."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
