PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1787789950
OL,3,CBook of condolence opens for rugby
OL,4,Cleague legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,6,FThe Prime Minister himself paid
OL,7,Ftribute to rugby league's first night.
OL,8,FAn avid follower of the sport, Andy
OL,9,FBurnham said he was "heartbroken" to
OL,10,Flearn of his death, just four days
OL,11,Fafter the funeral of his wife, Lady
OL,12,FJoan.
OL,14,FHe wrote on X: "Billy was one of the
OL,15,Fgreatest rugby league players of all
OL,16,Ftime but also one of the kindest and
OL,17,Fmost down-to-earth people you could
OL,18,Fever wish to meet.
