PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1787789950
OL,3,CBook of condolence opens for rugby
OL,4,Cleague legend Sir Billy Boston
OL,6,F"He always had time for people and
OL,7,Fgave so much to back to his adopted
OL,8,Fhome, Wigan. I will miss him greatly
OL,9,Fand am thinking today of Billy's
OL,10,Ffamily, still grieving the recent loss
OL,11,Fof his beloved wife Joan.
OL,13,F"A giant of a man in every way. Thank
OL,14,Fyou, Billy, and rest in peace.
OL,16,FThe book of condolence is located
OL,17,Finside the SOL Suite, adjacent to the
OL,18,Fmain Arena Reception at Robin Parke,
OL,19,Fand supporters can visit daily between
OL,20,F9:30am and 5pm to sign it.
